    // spawnChance: 0-100 percent the bot rolls leg armor at all (the empty
    // holder is always injected). variants: relative weights per variant -
    // 0 means never pick. variant keys must match entries in the 'variants'
    // catalog above. overrides: per-role config keyed by exact SPT role
    // name (case-insensitive). when a bot's role matches an override key
    // it uses that block instead of the bucket. delete an override entry
    // to fall back to the bucket.

